d 'XMKDO': module to generate do-file scaffolds for replicable research workflows
d
d  xmkdo makes a do-file scaffold from the templates recommended by
d Long(2009) and then open it in Stata's Do-file Editor for further
d modification. It could be a springboard for you to set up your
d own sensible do-files. 
d
d KW: do-files
d KW: template
d KW: workflow
d
d Requires: Stata version 14
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261116
d
d Author: Yongyi Zeng,  School of Management, Xiamen University, China
d Support: email  zzyy@@xmu.edu.cn
d
d Author: Yancheng Chen,   School of Management, Xiamen University, China
d Support: email 25120242201569@@stu.xmu.edu.cn
d
d Author: Jinle Yan,   School of Management, Xiamen University, China 
d Support: email 17420242200903@@stu.xmu.edu.cn
d
f xmkdo.ado
f xmkdo.sthlp
